+ * Enough for ESP-IDF 5 / Arduino 3.x rmtWrite(): on CHnCONF1.tx_start the channel RAM items are parsed,
+ * reported to the host as "T <ch> <tick_ns> <carrier_hi> <carrier_lo> <carrier_en> <hex words...>" and the
+ * TX_END interrupt is raised after the frame's duration in virtual time. No RX, no ping-pong refill. */
